{"bookId":"cp-2","editionId":"6879da4e6ec271ab","chapterId":"c0124","paragraphs":[{"id":"p72d2c9358dc5-1","text":"绿丝低拂鸳鸯浦。"},{"id":"p7750469b68fb-1","text":"想桃叶、当时唤渡。"},{"id":"pccaacf48f75e-1","text":"又将愁眼与春风，待去。"},{"id":"p297158cc3931-1","text":"倚兰桡、更少驻。"},{"id":"p483ca68fb92b-1","text":"金陵路。"},{"id":"p62536fe68a11-1","text":"莺吟燕舞。"},{"id":"p7be81c8d82d9-1","text":"算潮水、知人最苦。"},{"id":"p1686979ddcd1-1","text":"满汀芳草不成归，日暮。"},{"id":"p9cb6669b5292-1","text":"更移舟、向甚处。"}]}